    "body": "So to double-check, do we have implementer buy-in for changing not only `link` and `style`, but also `meta` and `source`? I think it's best if we change them all, for consistency. But it is extra work, and some implementers might not be excited about doing that extra work so that you can do conditional meta theme colors.",
