    "body": "The layer syntax would only have meaning in the `link` & `style` elements - and is only _needed_ on the former (the CSS syntax can be used directly inside `style`). Other import conditions, such as support queries, may be useful on all three. We could narrow the scope of this PR to only the essential change, and expand later if desired?",
